  (text "AS5600 ENCODER BOARD (off-board), J5 C17-F17\nJ5 pins: 1 = VCC (3.3 V), 2 = GND, 3 = SDA, 4 = SCL. 0x36, I2C 400 kHz.\nEncoder-board DIR strapped to GND and OUT/PGO open: on that board, NOT on J5.\nPull-ups to 3.3 V only; set any 3.3 V / 5 V pad to 3.3 V. Never 5 V on ESP32 pins.\nMagnet: diametric disc on the spool axis, 0.5-3 mm above the chip, centred.\nKeep SDA/SCL/3V3/GND < 20 cm, twisted, away from motor wires." (at 72.39 208.28 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid 98ec2ef7-4d92-5c7d-87e1-964113f1533b)
  )
